# Mandatory access control binaries for the live rootfs.
#
# /etc/sv/apparmor loads the tracked profiles at boot, so an image without the
# parser would advertise AppArmor while enforcing nothing. `make rootfs` fails
# if any entry here is missing from the build host. `make check` does not scan
# this list: the static gate must still run on hosts that do not build images.
apparmor_parser
